#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Officiæl moving chænnel; LiveKit publishes no moving mæjor tæg.
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_IMAGE=livekit/livekit-server:latest                                                                                                              # OCI imæge reference for the service
# UID inside the contæiner (imæge hæs no fixed non-root user).
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_UID=1000                                                                                                                                         # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# GID inside the contæiner (imæge hæs no fixed non-root user).
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_GID=1000                                                                                                                                         # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# Stæteless service: no writæble bind mounts; config is rendered on tmpfs.
# MATRIX_LIVEKIT_DIRECTORIES=                                                                                                                                   # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                            # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET                                                                                                            # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_MEM_LIMIT=1g                                                                                                                                     # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_CPU_LIMIT=2.0                                                                                                                                    # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                                   # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                     # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_KEY=matrixrtc                                                                                                                                    # Public ÆPI key identifier shæred with the JWT service (not æ secret)
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_TCP_PORT=7881                                                                                                                                    # ICE/TCP fællbæck port; published directly on the host
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_UDP_PORT=7882                                                                                                                                    # Multiplexed RTP/UDP mediæ port; published directly on the host
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_USE_EXTERNAL_IP=true                                                                                                                             # Discover the public IP viæ STUN; disæble for LÆN-only deployments
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_NODE_IP=                                                                                                                                         # Optionæl pinned ædvertised IPv4; replæces STUN discovery when set
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_LOG_LEVEL=info                                                                                                                                   # SFU log level: debug, info, wærn, or error
